605ab10a2f6fc05ce91122bac88df0f233b62/ss_195605ab10a2f6fc05ce91122bac88df0f233b62.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756504813","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/195605ab10a2f6fc05ce91122bac88df0f233b62/ss_195605ab10a2f6fc05ce91122bac88df0f233b62.600x338.jpg?t=1756504813"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/7791e6276b7e32b99a16f2ffb4be9546eadb1d8b/ss_7791e6276b7e32b99a16f2ffb4be9546eadb1d8b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756504813","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/7791e6276b7e32b99a16f2ffb4be9546eadb1d8b/ss_7791e6276b7e32b99a16f2ffb4be9546eadb1d8b.600x338.jpg?t=1756504813"}],"short_description":"First-Person Survival Horror, 90\u2019s style. Hostile clowns lurk the woods. Fight-or-flight to uncover their gruesome secrets throughout a chilling Single-Player Story. Clever inventory management and resourcefulness are your only hopes to escape the Summer of 1999 alive.","steam_appid":3765700,"support_info":{"email":"ghostiegamesdev@proton.me","url":"https://www.ghostiegames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://www.ghostiegames.com/"}